id: zw_log_output_iostream
label: Z-Wave Log Output (sl_log iostream)
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  Internal output implementation of the Z-Wave Logging component. It requires an sl_log
  iostream backend (log_backend_iostream_formatted or log_backend_iostream_compact)
  and the console iostream: VCOM on SoC applications, SWO on NCP applications.
ui_hints:
  visibility: never
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license
requires:
- name: log_backend_iostream_impl
- name: iostream_eusart
  condition: [zaf_soc]
- name: iostream_swo
  condition: [zaf_ncp]
- name: zw_ncp_iostream_console
  condition: [zaf_ncp]
provides:
- name: zw_log_output_iostream
root_path: zwave
